{"slug":"j-n-b","ar":"ج ن ب","total":33,"core":"side; avoidance; impurity","forms":[{"ar":"جَانِب","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"side","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":52,"p":3,"ar":["وَنَـٰدَيْنَـٰهُ","مِن","جَانِبِ","ٱلطُّورِ","ٱلْأَيْمَنِ","وَقَرَّبْنَـٰهُ","نَجِيًّا"],"en":"And We called him from the side of the mount at [his] right and brought him near, confiding [to him]"}},{"ar":"ٱجْتَنَبُ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":9,"gloss":"to avoid, shun","word":null,"ex":{"s":42,"a":37,"p":2,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَجْتَنِبُونَ","كَبَـٰٓئِرَ","ٱلْإِثْمِ","وَٱلْفَوَٰحِشَ","وَإِذَا","مَا","غَضِبُوا۟","هُمْ","يَغْفِرُونَ"],"en":"And those who avoid the major sins and immoralities, and when they are angry, they forgive"}},{"ar":"جَنب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":8,"gloss":"side, flank","word":null,"ex":{"s":32,"a":16,"p":2,"ar":["تَتَجَافَىٰ","جُنُوبُهُمْ","عَنِ","ٱلْمَضَاجِعِ","يَدْعُونَ","رَبَّهُمْ","خَوْفًا","وَطَمَعًا","وَمِمَّا","رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","يُنفِقُونَ"],"en":"They arise from [their] beds; they supplicate their Lord in fear and aspiration, and from what We have provided them, they spend"}},{"ar":"جُنُب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"impure; distant","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":11,"p":7,"ar":["وَقَالَتْ","لِأُخْتِهِۦ","قُصِّيهِ ۖ","فَبَصُرَتْ","بِهِۦ","عَن","جُنُبٍ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يَشْعُرُونَ"],"en":"And she said to his sister, \"Follow him\"; so she watched him from a distance while they perceived not"}},{"ar":"يَتَجَنَّبُ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"to avoid","word":null,"ex":{"s":87,"a":11,"p":1,"ar":["وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا","ٱلْأَشْقَى"],"en":"But the wretched one will avoid it"}},{"ar":"يُجَنَّبُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"to be kept away","word":null,"ex":{"s":92,"a":17,"p":1,"ar":["وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا","ٱلْأَتْقَى"],"en":"But the righteous one will avoid it"}},{"ar":"ٱجْنُبْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to keep away","word":null,"ex":{"s":14,"a":35,"p":9,"ar":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","رَبِّ","ٱجْعَلْ","هَـٰذَا","ٱلْبَلَدَ","ءَامِنًا","وَٱجْنُبْنِى","وَبَنِىَّ","أَن","نَّعْبُدَ","ٱلْأَصْنَامَ"],"en":"And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said, \"My Lord, make this city [Makkah] secure and keep me and my sons away from worshipping idols"}}],"surahs":[[4,5],[28,4],[22,3],[5,2],[17,2],[39,2],[3,1],[9,1],[10,1],[14,1],[16,1],[19,1],[20,1],[32,1],[37,1],[41,1],[42,1],[49,1],[53,1],[87,1],[92,1]]}